# Several crates here (backtest, dataloader, data_prep, genetic, metrics,
# orderbook, and everything depending on ultra-logger) depend on sibling
# repos (databaseschema, LoggingEngine) as git dependencies pinned to tags
# instead of local `path =` deps. Cargo's own bundled libgit2 doesn't
# reliably pick up the same credential helpers the `git` CLI already has
# configured (Windows Credential Manager locally, a PAT-based `insteadOf`
# rewrite in CI) -- shelling out to the real `git` binary for fetches
# avoids re-solving credentials a second, different way.
